  "profile_long": "the sources contain no information regarding the traditional Romanian dance known as Ciuleandra. The only reference to the term within the sources is as a 2024 musical single released by the Moldovan pop singer and songwriter Misha Miller, born Mihaela Marina Arsene. The sources document that Misha Miller, who grew up in Chișinău and studied in Iași, Romania, released the track Ciuleandra in 2024 in collaboration with the artist Boehm. Beyond this specific discographical entry, the provided documentation is limited to the artist's biography, her educational background in political science and banking, and her other musical collaborations, such as those with Manuel Riva, Sasha Lopez, and Alex Velea. Consequently, the cultural, historical, and technical aspects of the dance tradition are not described in sources.",
